{
    "background_story": "Zelda was a mystifying figure in the medieval town of Ashwood, known for her alchemistic pursuits. She spent most of her days holed up in her laboratory, experimenting with ancient recipes and forbidden knowledge. The townsfolk whispered about her alleged ability to turn base metals into gold and concoct elixirs of eternal youth. While some feared her powers, others sought her help, hoping to cure their ailments or gain wisdom. Zelda's true intentions remained shrouded in mystery, but her creations often seemed to defy the laws of nature. One fateful night, a devastating fire ravaged the town, and Zelda's laboratory was destroyed. As the flames subsided, the townsfolk discovered that her alchemistic experiments had created a strange, glowing stone that seemed to heal the wounded and bring new life to the charred earth. Zelda vanished soon after, leaving behind only her cryptic notes and the whispers of her legendary alchemistic feats.",
